    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Xiao Qi Xing cultivates human path and obtains an incomplete Gu Immortal true inheritance with ten or so Immortal Gu recipes of justice Gu. The most exceptional recipe among them uses wealth Immortal Gu as the supplementary material to refine justice Immortal Gu. He wants rank six justice Immortal Gu as his vital Gu so he can become a human path Gu Immortal, and under ideal ascension conditions he hopes that vital Gu advances to rank seven. He calls justice Gu a human path Gu worm, and with soldier Gu, sergeant Gu, lieutenant Gu, and so on he plans the human path killer move commander of justice as a possible trump card.",
