  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In Fang Yuan’s human path dream realm exploration, a traitor hint names justice Gu on the clan leader role. On a later attempt Fang Yuan activates justice Gu at the crucial moment: piercing white light bursts from his body, his speed returns, and he dodges a fatal blow. The dream realm character has rank five cultivation, many mortal Gu, five to six rank four Gu, and one rank five Gu, which is justice Gu. Justice Gu at rank five gives great strength in that fight.",
        "chapters": [
          1819
